info.description:
REST API for ontology management — classes, properties, individuals, versioning, and queries.

Base URL: `/api/v1`

All endpoints require authentication via Bearer JWT token in the `Authorization` header.

## Error format

All errors return:
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "GATEWAY-ERROR-CODE",
    "message": "Human-readable error description"
  }
}
```

## Pagination

List endpoints accept `page` and `per_page` query parameters and return:
```json
{
  "data": [...],
  "meta": {
    "page": 1,
    "per_page": 20,
    "total": 42,
    "total_pages": 3
  }
}
```
